 you seek Wi-Fi-enabled switches, dimmable lighting control, or surge protection sockets, we have the perfect solution to match your requirements. With simple and intuitive interfaces, our products cater to both tech enthusiasts and beginners alike.','Easy Installation and Integration','2023-08-06 05:46:22',NULL),(94,15,NULL,'We understand the importance of hassle-free installation, and our smart switches and sockets are designed for easy setup. No one needs to hire any technical expert to install our smart switch & socket. With our step-by-step instructions, you can transform your home into a smart space within minutes. Seamlessly integrate our devices into your existing smart home ecosystem.','Safety and Reliability','2023-08-06 05:47:03',NULL),(95,15,NULL,'Safety is our utmost priority, and all our products undergo rigorous testing to ensure compliance with international safety standards. Our smart device is built with high-quality materials and durable construction, our smart switches and sockets are built to last. Our high quality smart switch and socket protect your family and belongings.','Smart Home Automation','2023-08-06 05:47:44',NULL),(96,15,NULL,'The integration of our smart switches and sockets into a comprehensive smart home automation system takes your home to the next level. Anyone can control temperature, lighting, water heating and many more with a single touch from your smartphone. Our products enable you to create a customized and efficient smart home environment.','Customer Reviews and Testimonials','2023-08-06 05:48:45',NULL),(97,15,NULL,'We take pride in our satisfied customers who have experienced the transformational power of our smart switches and sockets. Check out our website for authentic customer reviews and testimonials, which speak to the reliability and efficiency of our products.','Warranty and Customer Support','2023-08-06 05:49:23',NULL),(98,15,NULL,'To ensure your peace of mind, we offer 1 year free replacement & 5 years service